flowchart TD
 history[Observed q_t and r_t] --> interaction[M of q_t+Q*r_t plus P_t]
 query[Known q_t+1] --> exercise[E of q_t+1]
 interaction --> kv[Learned K and V]
 exercise --> q[Learned Q]
 kv --> prefix[Valid causal prefix sums]
 prefix --> attn[Normalized ELU+1 multihead attention]
 q --> attn
 attn --> residual[Output projection, dropout, residual m+e, layer norm]
 residual --> ffn[Compact FFN d to d/2 to d, residual and norm]
 ffn --> probability[Sigmoid next-response probability]
 probability --> loss[Masked BCE against r_t+1]
